  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Decarbonization and sustainable cities for a  net-zero future in Malaysia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project#s objective is to catalyze urban decarbonization in the state of Selangor, Malaysia as a strategic entry point for addressing climate change, biodiversity loss, and land degradation by integrating innovative policies, technologies, and financing mechanisms into city planning and investment frameworks, creating scalable models for sustainable, resilient, and inclusive urban development in Malaysia.</narrative>
  </description>
